<title>USA: TGX lists Series A redeemable senior pr.</title>
<headline>TGX lists Series A redeemable senior pr.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>TGX Corp said it received approval to list its Series A Redeemable Senior Preferred Stock on the Bulletin Board of the NASDAQ under the symbol &quot;TGXCP.&quot;</p>
<p>TGX, an independent, domestic oil and gas production and exploration company, operates on-shore primarily in Arkansas, Louisiana, Oklahoma and Texas.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
